# Cursor Rules — SpillSense (SIH 26143)
# Read the complete context in AGENTS.md before planning or generating code.

You must follow the architecture, conventions, and constraints documented in AGENTS.md:
- Frontend: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite + CesiumJS 1.146 + Leaflet + Tailwind CSS
- Backend: FastAPI + Uvicorn + WebSockets + DuckDB
- Deploy: Frontend on Vercel; Backend on persistent server (Render/Railway/VPS)
- Cesium: Never use negative eyeOffset; always set disableDepthTestDistance: Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY
- Run `npm --prefix frontend run test` and `npm --prefix frontend run build` to verify changes.
